School Staff Attendance Mobile App
Software Requirement Document (SRD)
Version: 1.0 (MVP)
 Platform: Android (React Native)

1. Project Overview
Project Name
School Staff Attendance Mobile App
Purpose
The School Staff Attendance Mobile App is designed exclusively for school employees to mark their daily attendance using GPS Location Verification and a Live Selfie Capture.
The application aims to eliminate proxy attendance and ensure that staff can mark attendance only while physically present within the school campus.
Note: This application is only for staff members. All employee accounts are created and managed by the School Admin through the Admin Portal. Staff cannot register themselves.

