14. Security Features
GPS Validation
Attendance only inside school radius.

Live Selfie
Mandatory.
Gallery Upload Disabled.

Fake GPS Detection
Attendance blocked if mock location is detected.

Secure Login
JWT Authentication
Secure Session Storage
HTTPS APIs

15. Offline Behaviour
The application requires an active internet connection for attendance marking.
Offline attendance is not supported in Version 1.0.

16. Error Handling
Examples:
Internet unavailable
GPS disabled
Camera permission denied
Outside school radius
Invalid credentials
Attendance already marked
Server unavailable
Each error should show a clear and user-friendly message.

