19. Success Criteria
The application will be considered successful when:
Staff can securely log in using admin-provided credentials.
Attendance can only be marked from within the configured school geofence.
Every attendance record includes a live selfie and GPS location.
Attendance history and leave information are easily accessible.
The app provides a simple, fast, and reliable experience for daily school staff attendance.
